k": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}], "template_override": 1}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "It's Time to Travel"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Catching up with Peter and John"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Future Forms "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Continuous</span> to talk about current actions happening now or future arrangements. <br /><br /> subject + to be + <span class=\"italic\">verb</span> + ing <br /> Example: <br /><span class=\"italic\">I am <span class =\"strong\">applying</span> for a new job.</span> <br>   <br>You use <span class=\"strong\">be going to</span> to talk about future intentions. You use the form:<br>   <br>subject + to be + going to + <span class=\"italic\">verb </span><br> Example:<br> <span class=\"italic\"> I'm going to <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">start</span></span> applying for jobs.</span><br>  <br>You can use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Present</span> tense to talk about future schedules.<br> Example:<br> <span class=\"italic\">The job <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">starts</span></span> in two weeks.</span>"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Life Events"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<br>Events that happen in your life are called life events. There are names for these events. Here are a few:<br>  <span class=\"italic\"><br><ul><li>first day of school/work</li> <li>birthday</li> <li>graduation</li> <li>getting a job</li> <li>promotion</li> <li>wedding</li> <li>having a baby</li> <li>anniversary (10th/25th)</li> <li>retiring</li></ul> </span>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to graduate "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to get a degree from a college or university "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm graduating soon from college."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you can use to talk about key life events."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to have a blast "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to have a lot of fun; a great time "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's looks like you're having a blast in Paris!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cruise ship"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large ship that people have holidays on "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I got a job on a cruise ship. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to fly "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to travel by plane"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm flying to South America next week."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to notice "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to realize"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You won't notice we're gone."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Congratulations! "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "use to say you are happy about something someone achieved"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Congratulations on your new job!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "aunt "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the sister of your mother or father "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She's going to visit her aunt!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le01ob10aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_wo